{"symbol":"SAFE","yahoo":"SAFE.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"Sodhani Academy of Fintech Enablers Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Business Services","website":"https://www.safefintech.in","about":"Sodhani Academy of Fintech Enablers Limited, a technology-led, hybrid education firm, engages in the training and learning business in India. The company offers learning and training solution, such as personal finance, investment and portfolio management, basic financial planning, basic banking and financial services knowledge, financial literacy for youth and women, corporate training, and SIP education and awareness courses. It also provides online/live sessions, digital modules, offline seminars, and certification courses. In addition, the company is involved in manufacturing of agricultural products. It serves students, fresh graduates, homemakers, and aspiring retail investors seeking knowledge in financial planning, stock market fundamentals, trading strategies, and wealth management. The company was formerly known as Sodhani Financial Consultants Limited and changed its name to Sodhani Academy of Fintech Enablers Limited in May 2023. Sodhani Academy of Fintech Enablers Limited was incorporated in 2009 and is based in Jaipur, India.","updated":"2026-09-30T12:13:29+00:00","quote":{"price":138.0,"prevClose":138.0,"marketCap":78.59,"high52":348.0,"low52":112.8,"pe":22.62,"bookValue":30.03,"dividendRate":0.75,"roe":22.36,"shares":0.5695,"insiders":76.37,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2024-09-23","2024-09-24","2024-09-25","2024-09-26","2024-09-27","2024-09-30","2024-10-01","2024-10-03","2024-10-04","2024-10-07","2024-10-08","2024-10-09","2024-10-10","2024-10-11","2024-10-14","2024-10-15","2024-10-16","2024-10-17","2024-10-18","2024-10-21","2024-10-22","2024-10-23","2024-10-24","2024-10-25","2024-10-28","2024-10-29","2024-10-30","2024-10-31","2024-11-01","2024-11-04","2024-11-05","2024-11-06","2024-11-07","2024-11-08","2024-11-